; ---------------------------------------------------------
; VNKit demo script
; Shows: backgrounds, characters, choices, variables,
;        conditional branching, cross-script goto.
; Enable "Use Placeholder Graphics" on the engine to run
; this demo without any art assets.
; ---------------------------------------------------------

# Start

@bg Campus time:0.8
@bgm ThemeDay fade:1.5
@set affection=0

A warm spring afternoon. The school day is finally over.

@char Ayame.Smile pos:center time:0.5
Ayame: Hey, you actually came! [br]I wasn't sure you would.
Ayame: The view from the rooftop is amazing at this hour.

@char Ayame pos:left time:0.5
@char Rin.Default pos:right time:0.5
Rin: Oh. You brought someone along.
@sfx Chime

Ayame.Smile: This is the transfer student I told you about.

@choice "Greet Rin warmly" goto:Warm do:affection+=1 | "Nod quietly" goto:Quiet

# Warm
Rin.Smile: ...Hi. Nice to meet you, I guess.
Ayame: See? I told you she warms up fast.
@goto Rooftop

# Quiet
Rin: Hm. The quiet type, huh.
Ayame: Give them a chance, Rin.
@goto Rooftop

# Rooftop

@bg Rooftop time:1.2
@stopBgm fade:2

The three of you watch the clouds drift by.

Ayame: Days like this make everything feel possible.

@if affection>0 goto:GoodEnd else:NormalEnd

# GoodEnd
@bgm ThemeSunset fade:1
Rin.Smile: You're alright. Come back tomorrow, okay?
@goto Finale

# NormalEnd
Rin: ...See you around, I suppose.
@goto Finale

# Finale
@hideChars time:1.0
And so the day quietly came to an end.[br][br]<i>Thanks for trying VNKit!</i>
@goto Epilogue.Start
